# flame-capture.script — Q4 upgrade (final wave): thrust flame HELD ACROSS a
# capture boundary. session.script releases thrust >=10 boundaries before every
# capture, so no compared Q13/Q10/Q11 frame contains a flame pixel; this
# fixture captures one that does.
#
# Timeline: start game -> no-thrust control capture (start) -> keydown 'o' ->
# capture 'flame' WHILE still held (4 boundaries after the press) -> keyup.
# The 'flame' capture on X11 is the masked-compare reference for the GL leg
# (crops 40,179,640,512 / 24,175,640,512, qa/phase5-evidence/masks-q10 regime);
# the paired flame-control.script (nop at the same boundaries) is the no-thrust
# control for the localization assertion.
#
# Run:
#   ./obj/harness --seed 12345 --script test/harness/scripts/flame-capture.script \
#       --out DIR --hiscore test/harness/fixtures/hiScore.nul.data \
#       --handshake frame --keep

1    capture help      # title screen == help screen (task-7); q10 help mask applies

3    keydown s
6    keyup s
40   capture start

50   keydown o
54   capture flame             # thrust HELD: flame pixels present
90   keyup o

130  keydown q
134  keyup q
exit
